{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイトルはみり愛が\n考えました。理由はわからない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！\n伊藤純奈です(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/08/27/9736313/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このにゃにゃせさん\n可愛すぎるらぶ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよ！\n明日から！神宮だああああ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/08/27/9736313/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お天気が悪いようで。。\nてるてる坊主に頼ろう。。。\nついでにてぃーちゃ(川後)は\nお天気を操れる魔法使いちゃん\nだからてぃーちゃんにもお願い\nしなきゃ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"755にまなったん坊主と\nほりほり坊主とじゅんじゅん坊主の\n動画あげたからよかったら\nみてね。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最高のバースデーライブに\nするぞー(>_<)！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/08/27/9736313/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！ちなみに\nサイリウムカラーは\n「水色×ピンク」です♡\nうちわ、タオルもぜったい\nみつけるね♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\n会場でお会いしましょう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/08/27/9736313/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、髪色変えたよ\n見つけてね( ^ω^ )"}],"source":"archive"}